MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Aur: A goddess descended from Yu Phas who fights the\nunderworld armies with a mysterious power.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Pet0: A crack shot with a bow, he can use combat arts to\nhit distant foes.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Hur: A fiercely kind young woman who is proficient in\nbattling foes as well as healing allies.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Jes: A swordsman who uses speed to toy with enemies.\nHe uses the combat art Swap to mix up the battle.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Gol: A giant with overpowering strength and defense.\nHis hulking physique lets him wear heavy armor.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Dan: An advanced magic user and litterateur whose\nprecise instructions can enhance her allies' abilities.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Esm: A strong young woman who can stand up to any foe.\nHowever heavy the armor, she wears it lightly.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Sim: A battle-hungry combat expert to his core. Even with\na fatal blow, it'll take much more to bring him down.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Lou: A graceful blade user who overwhelms her foes with\nflurries. Her enemies can run, but they won't escape.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Fia: A healing cleric who walks in an aura of darkness.\nWith acute magic control, she can heal many allies.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Lor0: A scrappy girl who's nimble and knows it. She can\ndodge any attack when she's at her best.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Set: A traveler with great spear skills and a fair bit of\nwisdom. He counters his enemies swiftly.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Nin: An eerie woman who serves as a temple vulkan and\nsenses spirits. She can ward off magic attacks.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Lil: An archer with reliable aim. She's adept at attacking\nfrom range against enemies unable to counter.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Lys: An excellent knight who uses his speed in battle.\nHe excels at closing the distance and striking first.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Sci: An enigmatic bard adept with swords as well as\nmagic, able to wield a variety of weapons.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Moo0: An inexperienced fighter. What she lacks in battle\nexperience, she makes up for with growth potential.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Mic: An experienced soldier skilled in close combat. She\ncan read her opponents and score hits with ease.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Oly: A passionate singer and priest who is skilled in white\nmagic. She will do all it takes to seize victory.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Naz: A young swordsman with extraordinary strength.\nIf he strikes first, his attacks gain more force.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Dai: A bold fighter of considerable physical strength who\nholds nothing back in combat.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Hal: A talented archer and traveling performer who can\nadapt to any battle situation.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Guj: A mercenary who plays up his skills and victories,\nthough some of it may actually be true.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Yan: A wandering warrior monk who can both fight and\nheal. He possesses mysterious techniques.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Iio: A young mercenary who takes to battle with his\ntrusty steed. Uses his mobility to great advantage.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Pep: A skilled hunter who's quick with his weapons and\ncan surprise weakened prey for a lethal finish.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Noc: A fighter whose punches are fast and fierce. She can\navoid attacks as her focus increases during battle.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Sop: A priest who specializes in healing magic and can\nincrease its effects. Has a huge appetite.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Cat: A sterling mercenary with proven skill. She seizes\nthe advantage and raises precision with great speed.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Ned: A mercenary who fights as one with her ornius. \nManeuvers so nimbly that she strikes fear into foes.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Zac: A sneaky axe-wielding man who was raised by\nbandits. His axe attacks boast high accuracy.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Maj: A brute known for his strength and violence. His\nferocity grows when he's equipped with an axe.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Ven: A veteran rider who's zealous about chariots, and\nwhose accuracy improves when he's riding one.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Ini: An archery expert who shoots powerful arrows that\ncan pierce the strongest armor.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Jas: A mercenary leader who specializes in defense.\nReturns attacks as highly accurate counterattacks.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Ale: A pegasus knight whose slight build enables her to\ndance upon the air. Enjoys the fellowship of friends.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Cle: 
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Mys: 
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Cen: A heavily armored veteran with defensive power like\nan iron wall. He can withstand heavy attacks.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Asw: A sniper of nearly godlike ability, she can deliver\narrows with devastating accuracy.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Nat: A general worth a thousand men. He boasts great\noffensive power and leads from the front.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Hri: A cunning general with outstanding tactical abilities.\nHe fights defensively and toys with enemies.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Gra: 
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Kir: A notorious pirate who's lost his ship and crew. His\nattacks are very effective against defenseless foes.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Nuz: A forest warrior and peerless killer. He exploits his\nenemies' weaknesses without mercy.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Kra: A defensive stalwart with martial skills and healing\nmagic. His indomitable spirit keeps him standing.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Ann: A spirited elephant rider who tramples enemy\nformations all across the battlefield.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tia0: A tactical genius whose skillful strategizing lets her\nput allies' abilities to good use.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Fab: An enigmatic missionary skilled in dark magic. His\nspecial techniques break the enemy's will to fight.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Bon: The Mastermind of Saramis, wielder of blades and\nmagic. His counsel improves his allies' accuracy.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tob: The Lionheart of Saramis, as strong as he is tough.\nHis well-honed skills can wreak havoc in battle.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Buc: A veteran guardian compared to a demon bear\nbecause he's so impervious to enemy attacks.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Gat: A warrior trained in the eastern lands who carves\na path to victory with exceptional swordsmanship.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Urs: The manager of Vandahl Trading. Her business\nacumen allows all units to use the Storage command.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Die: A skilled, taciturn warrior from a forest clan. He\nwon't allow those in his protection to be struck twice.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Sar: A spirit-magic specialist. She can instantly move\nallies to safety and heal their wounds.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Kai0: A lively boy who is motivated by love for his family.\nHe takes naturally to battlefield action.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Dit: A foreign swordsman who duels to slake his thirst. \nHis blade bathes his foes in a deadly light.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Seo: The dauntless queen of Saramis. Her unyielding\nresolve allows her to rise to any challenge.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Led: A dancer and player of enchanting music, she avoids\ncounterattacks with ease and grace.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Bel: A proud warrior fighting for his freedom. He can\nunleash fierce barrages of attacks on his enemies.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tal: The greatest merchant in Dagda. Gifted with natural\nluck, his ambitious heart yearns for adventure.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Orh: A maiden whose formidable form contains mysteries.\nVery strong, but barred from some soldier classes.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Anh: A young Mediator fighting to save her people. Skilled\nin energy-flow-based martial arts and dodging.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Kou: A powerful mage trained in the magic of Kunlun.\nHer magical strikes are swift and precise.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tro: An aged warrior whose power is backed up by her\nexperience. She excels in combat using gauntlets.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Kai1: A young man motivated by love for his family.\nHe takes naturally to battlefield action.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tia1: A tactical genius whose skillful strategizing lets her\nput allies' abilities to good use.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Pet1: A crack shot with a bow, he can use combat arts to\nhit distant foes.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Moo1: A young woman who has seen many battlefields but\nhas the potential to become even more formidable.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Lor1: A scrappy girl who's nimble and knows it. She can\ndodge any attack when she's at her best.
MID_ScoutInfo_Characteristic_Tah: A warrior trained in the Python Technique who\nproudly protects her lady and everyone else.